enIDConnectAuth.discover(OpenIDConnectAuth.java:42)\r\n        at io.vertx.ext.auth.oauth2.providers.KeycloakAuth.discover(KeycloakAuth.java:120)\r\n```\r\nI'm not sure, but maybe it's an expected behaviour....\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/551048479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"marcinczeczko","id":4218395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTgzOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4218395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko","html_url":"https://github.com/marcinczeczko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2779102933,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDI3NzkxMDI5MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/2779102933","actor":{"login":"marcinczeczko","id":4218395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTgzOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4218395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko","html_url":"https://github.com/marcinczeczko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinczeczko/followers","following_url":